Warzag.app contains only Warzag's own code. The engine it downloads (the runtime pack) and the Steam bridge in it are
built from the third-party components below, each under its own license. The engine carries their license texts in
Contents/Resources/licenses and Contents/share/warzag/bridge/licenses.

The corresponding source of the LGPL components (Wine, DXMT, GnuTLS, GMP, Nettle) is published with each release that
ships an engine: an archive of their pinned upstream sources, and this repository at the release's tag, which holds
the patches and build scripts (docs/BUILDING.md).


Engine

- Wine 11.19: LGPL-2.1-or-later. https://www.winehq.org
  The third-party libraries in Wine's libs/ directory keep their own licenses (see the Wine source).
- neutron, commit 0ac2574d46c186664f40b8efd0410e3d8145aa14: the build recipe and the patches applied to Wine, FEX,
  DXMT, llvm-mingw and lsteamclient. Each patch is under the license of the project it changes; neutron's own files
  are LGPL-2.1-or-later. https://github.com/lixsldotnet/neutron
- A Wine patch (WINEDLLPATH_PREPEND) from highball-engine, commit bd456bb2, originally from the MacPorts
  game-porting-toolkit port: LGPL-2.1. https://github.com/gauthierpiarrette/highball-engine
- FEX FEX-2610, commit 14c92681f4d62cf84d901460e0358de09c8847a7: MIT. https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX
  It includes code under BSD-, MIT- and Boost-style licenses: SoftFloat-3e, VIXL, xxHash, cephes, fmt, range-v3,
  rpmalloc, tiny-json, unordered_dense, cpp-optparse and musl.
- DXMT, commit e94c312f5c054263acf261cfa109edf13e757587: LGPL-2.1-or-later. https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt
  It includes MIT-licensed code: NVIDIA's NVAPI headers, Microsoft's DXBC parser, parts of dxbc-spirv and DXMT's own
  code up to v0.80.
- LLVM 15.0.7 libraries, linked into DXMT's shader converter: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.
  https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project
- llvm-mingw 20260908 runtime libraries (libc++, libunwind, compiler-rt) in the Windows-side files: Apache-2.0 WITH
  LLVM-exception. https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw
- mingw-w64 runtime, commit 9f55f4a2d3b9783dab76d9808be3d6279b99ec2a: ZPL-2.1 and public domain.
  https://www.mingw-w64.org
- SDL 3.4.18: Zlib. https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL
- sdl2-compat 2.32.74: Zlib. https://github.com/libsdl-org/sdl2-compat
- GnuTLS 3.8.3: LGPL-2.1-or-later. https://www.gnutls.org
- Nettle 3.10.2: LGPL-3.0-or-later or GPL-2.0-or-later. https://www.lysator.liu.se/~nisse/nettle/
- GMP 6.3.0: LGPL-3.0-or-later or GPL-2.0-or-later. https://gmplib.org
- FreeType 2.13.3: FreeType License. https://freetype.org
  Portions of this software are copyright (C) 2024 The FreeType Project (https://freetype.org). All rights reserved.

GnuTLS, GMP and FreeType are built from CodeWeavers' CrossOver 26.3.0 source archive,
https://www.codeweavers.com/crossover/source.


Steam bridge

- lsteamclient from Valve's Proton, branch proton_11.0, commit 5b89db940e0ebe3a137a6009a3589232fe084c09: Steamworks
  SDK license. https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton
  Fetched from Valve at build time and shipped as a separate component; it is not linked with GPL code.
- steam.exe, derived from Proton's steam_helper: BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Valve Corporation and Warzag contributors.


